[section WIDGETS]

[list_begin definitions]

[call [cmd widget::arrowbutton] [arg pathname] [opt options]]

A [cmd ttk::button] showing an arrow (package
[package widget::arrowbutton]).  It takes all options of
[cmd ttk::button] except [option -image], and the option:

[list_begin options]
[opt_def -orientation [arg direction]]
The direction of the arrow: one of [const up], [const down],
[const left], [const right], [const upleft], [const upright],
[const downleft], [const downright], or [const star] for arrows in all
directions.  No arrow is shown until it is set.
[list_end]

