[call [cmd widget::scrolledtext] [arg pathname] [opt options]]

A [cmd text] widget with scrollbars, in a [cmd widget::scrolledwindow]
(package [package widget::scrolledtext]).  It takes the options and
subcommands of [cmd text], except for the following options, which
are those of the scrolled window:

[list_begin options]
[opt_def -scrollbar [arg which]]
Which scrollbars there are: [const both] (default), [const vertical],
[const horizontal] or [const none].
[opt_def -auto [arg which]]
Which of the scrollbars are shown only when needed: [const both]
(default), [const vertical], [const horizontal] or [const none].
[opt_def -sides [arg sides]]
The sides on which the scrollbars are placed: one of [const se]
(default), [const sw], [const ne] or [const nw], or the same with the
letters swapped.
[opt_def -borderwidth [arg width]]
[opt_def -relief [arg relief]]
The border around the text and its scrollbars.
[list_end]

